WEBVTT

00:03:28.936 --> 00:03:30.179
got what they were deserved.

00:03:30.179 --> 00:03:32.630
They were part of the bad guys.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.178
And that creates some form of comfort

00:03:35.178 --> 00:03:36.810
for a lot of people.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:39.774
However, while it's easier to think

00:03:39.774 --> 00:03:43.759
of us, the citizens, the police, the army,

00:03:43.759 --> 00:03:47.331
as the good guys, and them, the narcos,

00:03:47.331 --> 00:03:50.625
the carteles, as the bad guys,

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:51.791
if you think about it,

00:03:51.791 --> 00:03:55.599
the latter are only providing a service to the former.

00:03:55.599 --> 00:03:57.714
Whether we like it or not,

00:03:57.714 --> 00:04:00.375
the U.S. is the largest market